			],
			"Message": "docs(Vine): Enrich funding acknowledgements and polish README\n\nExpand the Funding & Acknowledgements section with an introductory paragraph framing Land's open-source mission, and add a table header row identifying each sponsor column for clarity. Lowercase the Land URL to match the standard domain form. Soften the Changelog link text to reduce redundancy.\n\nThe revised table structure removes reliance on logo-only identification, making the sponsorship hierarchy immediately scannable at a glance.",
			"SHA": "f613f1c099c78db0f9a66db55cd6cbd82b9619ab"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-07-08T16:09:16Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				2516,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Vine): Remove unnecessary em-spaces after emoji inline markers\n\nRemove the redundant &#x2001; (em-space) HTML entity that followed emoji inline markers next to component names throughout README.md. The emoji character itself provides sufficient visual separation; the extra em-space created uneven spacing and doubled the gap.\n\nAlso remove the em-space trailing the System Architecture heading for consistent heading formatting.\n\nAffected components: Mountain ⛰️, Cocoon 🦋, Air 🪁, Grove 🌳, and Mist 🌫️.",
			"SHA": "eb38a23cc0e551ed0048ab045fb91cf3f2b48d38"
